WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.920 --> 00:03.920
You started this, Mr. Kang.

4
00:29.150 --> 00:35.580
Mmm hmmm... Mmhmm... Mmm...

5
00:51.800 --> 00:53.760
Why are you stopping?

6
01:47.940 --> 01:49.650
Ah... Mr. Kang...

7
01:49.650 --> 01:52.150
Ah, I really...

8
01:55.240 --> 01:57.030
That's a shame.

9
01:58.490 --> 01:59.789
What?

10
02:03.080 --> 02:08.669
I said a 10-minute break for the meeting, but 15 minutes have already passed.

11
02:20.140 --> 02:23.600
This is driving me crazy, seriously, Mr. Kang...

12
02:32.110 --> 02:36.780
Ko Taewoon / Kim Dohyun

13
02:48.540 --> 02:53.210
Baek Seunghoon / Lee Kyungwon

14
03:04.180 --> 03:12.150
Twisted Tie

15
03:12.150 --> 03:15.450
Episode 2. Hide and Seek Under the Desk

16
03:16.950 --> 03:24.290
For this Hannam-dong VIP lounge proposal, the overall traffic flow is too predictable.

17
03:24.290 --> 03:30.880
What the client requested is not an open space...

18
03:30.880 --> 03:36.550
that anyone can see, but a perfectly private structure that blocks all lines of sight.

19
03:37.800 --> 03:45.350
The exterior of the space may look cold and refined on the outside, but as you go further inside...

20
04:22.050 --> 04:24.720
Mr. Kang, coffee.

21
05:00.300 --> 05:03.930
Mr. Kang, this is really delicious.

22
05:03.930 --> 05:08.430
If you take care of me like this from now on, I'll truly be loyal to you for the rest of my life.

23
05:09.230 --> 05:13.940
Forget loyalty, just eat slowly before you choke.

24
05:19.740 --> 05:21.400
Um...

25
05:21.780 --> 05:25.950
What is your usual type, Mr. Kang?

26
05:26.620 --> 05:29.790
An ideal type question, all of a sudden?

27
05:31.370 --> 05:36.630
Well, recently we... had this and that happen,

28
05:36.630 --> 05:41.510
And since you're personally packing lunches for me, Mr. Kang,

29
05:41.920 --> 05:46.800
I feel like I don't really know much about you in return.

30
05:48.100 --> 05:52.640
Have you always liked my type?

31
05:55.100 --> 05:58.440
Hmm... Well.

32
05:59.320 --> 06:04.160
Originally, I liked people who are sensitive, neat freaks like me,

33
06:04.160 --> 06:07.740
and quiet.

34
06:07.740 --> 06:11.330
Ah... I see.

35
06:12.210 --> 06:16.040
- But that's changed a bit lately. - What?

36
06:16.040 --> 06:18.340
H... how so?

37
06:18.340 --> 06:22.970
Someone who eats whatever I give them, is simple,

38
06:23.510 --> 06:30.890
and even if they act like a wild beast sometimes, they just look cute and pretty to me.

39
06:35.230 --> 06:39.860
S-still, you should have a bite too, Mr. Kang.

40
06:40.190 --> 06:46.240
You gave me your portion too, and you've only been drinking water since last night.

41
06:49.990 --> 06:53.909
- I'm keeping my stomach empty for a reason. - What?

42
06:55.330 --> 06:58.670
Still, you shouldn't be on an empty stomach.

43
06:58.670 --> 07:03.050
Just one bite. Come on, hurry, say ahh.

44
07:04.590 --> 07:06.930
Such stubbornness...

45
08:01.940 --> 08:04.360
Ah, Mr. Kang, are you okay?

46
08:04.780 --> 08:06.860
Ah, my teeth bumped you.

47
08:06.860 --> 08:09.030
Are you... are you bleeding?

48
08:09.030 --> 08:12.070
Ahh, I must be crazy.

49
08:17.040 --> 08:21.540
Are you planning to eat me up?

50
08:23.040 --> 08:27.800
No, I'm sorry. I was confident in my kissing skills,

51
08:27.800 --> 08:33.179
but this stage with a man is really my first time, so I don't know where or how to start...

52
08:33.179 --> 08:37.600
Relax a bit, Mr. Lee.

53
08:37.600 --> 08:40.730
I'm the one who should be nervous.

54
08:44.150 --> 08:51.160
Don't use your teeth. You need to take it in completely with your lips, then use your tongue.

55
08:52.370 --> 08:56.200
Just do exactly as I teach you, understand?

56
08:56.200 --> 08:58.660
Yes... Mr. Kang.

57
09:58.720 --> 10:04.690
Do it yourself... You know how to, right?

58
10:10.280 --> 10:13.530
I'm going crazy, seriously.

59
10:21.580 --> 10:23.040
Wait...

60
10:24.250 --> 10:25.920
Ah... Sunwoo.

61
10:26.580 --> 10:28.290
Too deep...

62
10:35.970 --> 10:37.930
Are you okay?

63
10:37.930 --> 10:41.970
I feel like I did it too... roughly.

64
10:44.060 --> 10:49.190
If we do another practical tutoring session... I'm going to die.

65
10:52.740 --> 10:56.490
What... why are you looking at me like that?

66
10:57.870 --> 11:03.040
Mr. Kang, seriously, do you know you drive people crazy?

67
11:03.040 --> 11:08.080
You usually look like you wouldn't bleed even a drop if pricked, but...

68
11:09.750 --> 11:13.800
Stop talking nonsense and turn off the light. I'm tired.

69
11:32.020 --> 11:37.070
Instead of tutoring... I just want to keep holding you like this.

70
11:38.240 --> 11:41.620
Tomorrow, and the day after too.

71
11:46.120 --> 11:48.080
You really...

72
12:16.740 --> 12:22.320
On the existing blueprint, the service route in Zone B and the VVIP route are adjacent,

73
12:22.320 --> 12:26.790
so there's always a risk of accidental encounters during lounge operations.

74
12:31.040 --> 12:34.040
It was pointed out as a security vulnerability.

75
12:35.800 --> 12:41.300
Now, the traffic flow revision for Zone B... Mr. Lee, you took charge of this, right?

76
12:43.600 --> 12:45.560
Put it on the screen.

77
12:45.560 --> 12:47.600
Yes, Mr. Kang.

78
12:55.320 --> 12:59.150
Um, Mr. Kang, well... your tie is a little crooked.

79
12:59.820 --> 13:01.860
What are you doing right now?

80
13:02.950 --> 13:05.120
Ah, your tie was...

81
13:05.120 --> 13:06.950
Mr. Lee.

82
13:08.370 --> 13:10.920
Can't you distinguish between professional and personal matters?

83
13:12.500 --> 13:16.550
Do you think this is a place to entertain your personal jokes?

84
13:18.010 --> 13:21.130
Ah, no. I was just...

85
13:21.130 --> 13:26.390
Mr. Lee, it's meeting time with the whole team gathered.

86
13:26.850 --> 13:29.560
Get a grip on yourself.

87
13:29.560 --> 13:35.190
Put the proposal on the screen, step back, and do a proper briefing.

88
13:50.000 --> 13:51.910
What is this?

89
13:51.910 --> 13:56.250
Was last night... just a joke?

90
13:56.880 --> 14:04.340
Or am I just... a convenient sex partner he can call up, is that it?

91
14:08.930 --> 14:13.440
Mr. Kang, earlier in the meeting room, why on earth did you act like that?

92
14:13.440 --> 14:17.820
Last night, you treated me so sweetly,

93
14:17.820 --> 14:23.530
Last night was last night, and right now is working hours.

94
14:24.070 --> 14:27.740
I believe I told you to keep personal and professional matters separate.

95
14:28.620 --> 14:31.330
Personal and professional matters?

96
14:33.330 --> 14:37.080
Then what exactly am I to you, Mr. Kang?

97
14:37.080 --> 14:40.920
Just someone you call only at night when you need them,

98
14:40.920 --> 14:43.420
like a casual partner?

99
14:43.420 --> 14:48.260
Yes, keeping it professional? I understand perfectly.

100
15:16.750 --> 15:22.340
There are a lot of eyes on us. Are you really sulking?

101
15:30.220 --> 15:34.100
Mr. Kang, we just got feedback from the client regarding Zone A.

102
15:34.100 --> 15:34.980
- Yeah. - I need a quick approval...

103
15:34.980 --> 15:38.560
Hand it over. What... what's the issue?

104
15:39.650 --> 15:45.570
So there's a request to change the marble finish here to matte...

105
15:47.950 --> 15:49.700
Ah...

106
15:50.740 --> 15:52.280
Mr. Kang?

107
15:52.280 --> 15:55.910
Ah, keep going. To matte...

108
15:56.580 --> 15:59.120
To matte...

109
15:59.120 --> 16:03.300
If we change it to matte, the unit price...

110
16:15.430 --> 16:19.980
- That's enough, you may leave. - Yes, thank you.

111
16:27.610 --> 16:31.410
Lee Sunwoo, are you really crazy?

112
16:33.620 --> 16:36.580
You're really driving me... Haa...

113
16:43.710 --> 16:47.260
Where did you learn such cheeky behavior?

114
16:58.350 --> 17:03.060
M-Mr. Kang, what are you doing right now... Mr. Kang! Ah!

115
17:03.480 --> 17:07.069
Mr. Kang, the President wants you in the meeting room right away...

116
17:07.859 --> 17:09.780
Oh? Mr. Lee?

117
17:09.780 --> 17:14.240
What is it, Mr. Lee? I heard Mr. Kang called you. Where did Mr. Kang go?

118
17:14.240 --> 17:18.250
Ah, that... uh, Mr. Kang went down for a moment...

119
17:18.250 --> 17:23.040
- Mr. Lee... - Ah, no, well... an outside meeting. Yes, an outside meeting.

120
17:23.040 --> 17:31.680
- Mr. Lee, are you sick? You're sweating buckets... - Ah, no, no... Yeah...

121
17:31.680 --> 17:33.550
Alright.

122
17:33.930 --> 17:38.140
Ah, um, M... Mr. Kang said there was an issue at the VVIP lounge site,

123
17:38.140 --> 17:41.060
so he hurriedly left for the site.

124
17:41.060 --> 17:45.150
As for the meeting with the President, I will report to him over the phone... Yeah.

125
17:45.150 --> 17:48.230
Uh... alright. You startled me.

126
17:48.230 --> 17:54.990
- Mr. Lee, you really don't look well today, so take it easy. - Ah... yes... thank you.

127
18:06.710 --> 18:08.920
I'm going crazy, seriously.

128
18:10.670 --> 18:16.140
Mr. Lee, you are really terrible at lying.

129
18:18.180 --> 18:21.850
How can a team leader who left for the site go to the meeting room?

130
18:21.850 --> 18:26.980
Ah, that's because you kept teasing me from down there, Mr. Kang...

131
18:26.980 --> 18:32.610
Who played a joke first? You started it, and now you're pretending to be the victim?

132
18:42.580 --> 18:45.370
I'm not done yet.

133
19:25.500 --> 19:27.500
Mr. Baek,

134
19:27.500 --> 19:30.040
What are you... doing right now...

135
19:31.920 --> 19:35.010
I brought the additional order list you requested...

136
19:41.560 --> 19:43.270
You...

137
19:45.600 --> 19:47.600
What are you doing right now...

138
20:33.070 --> 20:39.240
Twisted Tie

139
20:39.240 --> 20:40.240
MkvDrama.net
